{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udcf7\ufe0f \u201cMAHOROBA CAT\u201d</strong> is a photo adventure game themed around <strong>\u201cTourism, Exploration, and Discovery!\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist is tasked by their boss with taking photos for a travel magazine and sets off on a journey across Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From famous landmarks to hidden gems and everyday scenes, you\u2019ll visit a wide variety of locations to create your own unique travel magazine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Staying in hotels, traveling by train and airplane\u2014these quintessential travel experiences are also part of the game\u2019s charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hold up your camera and take the best shot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/steam_page_09.gif?t=1751174300\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tourist attractions throughout Japan!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can easily visit tourist attractions throughout the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/steam_page_08.png?t=1751174300\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expanding World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stage inversion system allows you to explore every corner of the diorama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/steam_page_05.gif?t=1751174300\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3244270?t=1751174300","backgroun